    <p class="rfd-eyebrow">Reward for Discipline</p>
    <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="rfd-subline">LNGVTY (Aesthex Labs Private Limited)</p>

    <p class="rfd-intro">Consistency is the foundation of anything worth building, and LNGVTY exists on that very principle. Our success is not measured in revenue. It is measured in you adopting the habit of skincare and moving toward your peak beauty potential. Rupees 1,000 is a small price to pay to help build that habit.</p>
    <p class="rfd-intro-note">This page sets out how the programme runs: who is eligible, what counts as proof, and how the reward is given.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Eligibility</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Open to customers who purchase a <strong>30+30ml combo pack</strong> of any one of the three LNGVTY serums (Acne + Blemish Control, Deep Hydration + Glow, Dark Spots + Pore Control).</li>
        <li>The order must be placed <strong>on or before 30 September</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>Each customer is eligible for only one reward, on one 30+30ml bundle.</strong> A customer who purchases more than one bundle can still only enrol and be rewarded once under this programme.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Programme duration</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The challenge runs for <strong>8 weeks (56 days)</strong>, starting from the date the product is <strong>actually delivered</strong> to you (Day 0), not the order date, and not the shipped or dispatched date.</li>
        <li><strong>Day 0 is the date of actual delivery</strong>, as recorded in the courier and Shopify fulfilment record. This is the anchor for all 12 photo checkpoints below.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Proof of participation</h2>

      <p class="rfd-day0-note">Day 0 is the date of actual product delivery. All 12 checkpoints below are counted from that date, not the order or dispatch date.</p>

      <p>You must upload one photo every 5 days across the 56-day window: 12 checkpoints in total.</p>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Photo</th>
            <th>Day (from Day 0, your delivery date)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>1</td><td>Day 1</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td>Day 6</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3</td><td>Day 11</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td>Day 16</td></tr>
          <tr><td>5</td><td>Day 21</td></tr>
          <tr><td>6</td><td>Day 26</td></tr>
          <tr><td>7</td><td>Day 31</td></tr>
          <tr><td>8</td><td>Day 36</td></tr>
