        </tbody>
      </table>

      <ul>
        <li>Each photo must be uploaded on its checkpoint day. <strong>There is no grace period.</strong> A photo submitted on any day other than its checkpoint day does not count toward that checkpoint.</li>
        <li>You may miss <strong>up to 1</strong> of the 12 checkpoints and remain eligible for the reward.</li>
        <li>Missing 2 or more checkpoints disqualifies your entry from the reward. <strong>There is no partial credit.</strong> Submitting 9 or 10 photos does not earn a reduced or partial reward. The threshold is exactly 11 of 12.</li>
      </ul>

      <p><strong>What counts as a valid photo.</strong> Every submitted photo must show, in the same frame:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The LNGVTY serum bottle, clearly visible.</li>
        <li>Your face, clearly visible.</li>
        <li>The dropper with a drop of product, visible: proof the serum is actually being applied.</li>
        <li>The same person's face in every one of the 12 photos across the challenge.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>A photo missing any of the above (bottle, face, dropper or drop, or a different person's face) does not count as a valid checkpoint submission.</p>

      <p><strong>Submission channel: WhatsApp.</strong> Submit your checkpoint photos via WhatsApp, to <strong>+91 98197 34089</strong>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. The reward</h2>
      <p class="rfd-reward-line">Submit 11 or more of the 12 required photos and receive ₹1,000, no questions asked, paid directly to your bank account via UPI.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Review and verification</h2>
      <p>LNGVTY reserves the right to reject a submission that is not a genuine, unedited photo taken by the participant during the programme window.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. General conditions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>One reward per customer, per Section 1.</li>
        <li>The programme is tied to the original purchasing customer and is non-transferable.</li>
        <li>If your order is returned, cancelled, or refunded, your enrolment in the programme ends and no reward is payable.</li>
        <li>By submitting photos, you agree LNGVTY may use your submitted photos across LNGVTY's own social media pages (Instagram, and other LNGVTY-owned channels).</li>
        <li>LNGVTY reserves the right to modify or discontinue the programme for future entrants. Customers already enrolled will be honoured under the terms in place when they enrolled.</li>
        <li>These terms are governed by the laws of India.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="rfd-contact">Questions about the programme? Write to us on WhatsApp at <strong>+91 98197 34089</strong>.</p>
